Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.22,0:00:03.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alice ran away?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.46,0:00:05.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.37,0:00:06.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think she might have\Nbeen overwhelmed by all
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.04,0:00:09.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the interviews and things\Nwe had scheduled for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.44,0:00:12.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I always checked with her to see if\Nshe was tired and needed a break,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.74,0:00:16.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but she'd just smile and shake\Nher head and say she was fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.60,0:00:22.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll head to the Roppongi\Noffice right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.74,0:00:26.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once we find out where she's at,\Nwe can all go get her together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.38,0:00:35.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.76,0:00:41.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alice!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.66,0:00:48.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need to sign for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.58,0:00:54.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's from Wrath.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.40,0:00:56.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what they sent me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.50,0:01:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you stop making so much\Nnoise and kindly unpack me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.78,0:01:22.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, please.
