Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.24,0:01:35.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jeez, Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.58,0:01:37.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone's worried sick about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.94,0:01:38.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.86,0:01:40.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.76,0:01:42.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was very childish.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.64,0:01:44.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was desperate to speak with you alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.32,0:01:48.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And not in your virtual form,\Nbut your real physical self.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.20,0:01:51.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just you and I, face to face.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.78,0:01:53.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.16,0:01:56.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am so angry with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.44,0:01:58.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did you not tell me\Nyou were staying behind?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.94,0:02:01.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and of the possibility\Nyou would never return.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.46,0:02:06.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you had told me before I\Nreached the altar, I would have...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.68,0:02:08.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would have...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.16,0:02:11.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would have stayed and not fled here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.04,0:02:14.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am still a knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.24,0:02:16.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fighting evil is my duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.12,0:02:18.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.40,0:02:20.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did you face him alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.44,0:02:23.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A dreadful foe like that,\Nwhat were you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.16,0:02:26.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did you not want me there,\Nby your side, assisting you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.62,0:02:34.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who do you think I, Alice\NSynthesis 30, am, if not capable?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.36,0:02:37.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who am I in your eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.82,0:02:44.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.22,0:02:46.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're my hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.22,0:02:50.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you're not just my hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.32,0:02:51.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Underworlds, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.92,0:02:54.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the people who lived and died there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.14,0:02:55.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A hope that can't be replaced.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.94,0:02:58.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't want to lose you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.94,0:03:02.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to protect you so that\Nhope could last for the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.68,0:03:08.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.59,0:03:11.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This future, what do you\Nthink it will look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.84,0:03:16.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I can endure the loneliness\Nand chaos of this world,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.48,0:03:18.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,trapped inside this body made of steel,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.54,0:03:21.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what kind of future could\Nthere possibly be for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.46,0:03:24.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.37,0:03:27.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish I had an answer for that, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.06,0:03:32.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that you being here\Nwill change the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.22,0:03:35.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and you'll change it for the better.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.70,0:03:39.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And when all's said and\Ndone, Cardinal's hopes,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.92,0:03:41.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and Administrators,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.12,0:03:47.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and Bercouli's, and Eldrie's, and Eugeo's\Ntoo, will finally become a reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.26,0:03:49.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.90,0:03:58.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We must contact Rank at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.66,0:04:02.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It simply will not do to\Nmake her worry further.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.02,0:04:05.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm. Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.24,0:04:12.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.15,0:04:15.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she's here. She's\Nfine. Uh-huh. Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.30,0:04:16.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.40,0:04:20.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She says hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.90,0:04:22.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, she's not upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.64,0:04:25.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She feels bad, you know, for\Nall you're going through.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.86,0:04:30.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She also said you can spend\Nthe night here, if you want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.36,0:04:33.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She said I could? Really? Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.38,0:04:38.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that is the case, I would like\Nyou to show me around your home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.62,0:04:40.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will, won't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.22,0:04:45.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have never seen the inside of a\Nreal-world dwelling space before.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.20,0:04:47.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.36,0:04:50.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But like, it's not really that special.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.68,0:04:52.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's not a whole lot more to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.12,0:04:57.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, you'll like this part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.58,0:05:10.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.49,0:05:11.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this a training hall?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.92,0:05:12.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.26,0:05:15.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But in this world, we call it a dojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.86,0:05:17.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A dojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.70,0:05:27.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.61,0:05:29.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such a peculiar training sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.58,0:05:32.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quite different from\Nthose in the Underworld.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.82,0:05:38.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.73,0:05:39.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.14,0:05:40.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.92,0:05:43.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a training hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.88,0:05:45.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let us make use of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.54,0:05:46.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.44,0:05:49.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.22,0:05:51.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you used to that body?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.28,0:05:54.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No need to hold back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.72,0:06:04.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.42,0:06:08.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The day you and I first crossed swords in
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.32,0:06:10.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the garden on the 80th\Nfloor of the cathedral.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.46,0:06:13.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you clobbered the\Nhell out of me back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.46,0:06:15.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna let that happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.66,0:06:53.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I win again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.30,0:06:57.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks to my ultimate\Nskill, the steel headbutt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.86,0:07:01.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never heard of that one before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.32,0:07:02.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just invented it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.74,0:07:09.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will be alright now, Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.28,0:07:12.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know I can survive in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.56,0:07:17.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wherever I go, I will be myself\Nas long as I can wield a sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.16,0:07:24.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have realized that my fight is\Nnot over yet, and neither is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.10,0:07:31.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I will look forward, and only\Nforward, and keep moving ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.48,0:07:36.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then Kazuto tripped and fell. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.44,0:07:38.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is hard to believe he was so clumsy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.52,0:07:39.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.14,0:07:41.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could tell you stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.04,0:07:45.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kazuto, we have a lot to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.22,0:07:50.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First things first, I believe you owe\Nyour mother and I a proper apology.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.24,0:08:03.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Father, Mother, I didn't\Nmean to make you guys worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.98,0:08:05.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.12,0:08:07.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're used to it by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.52,0:08:12.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, this time, what you were doing\Nwas something very important, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.00,0:08:15.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you say you're going\Nto do something, do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.06,0:08:19.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the same with writing a\Nbook or sticking to a deadline.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.26,0:08:21.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Mom, that's your experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.04,0:08:23.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your mother left something out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.28,0:08:29.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For days, she had no idea where you were,\Nand she was getting sick from worrying.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.34,0:08:32.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand the importance\Nof what you accomplished.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.20,0:08:34.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, that does not\Nmean you get a pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.04,0:08:37.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kazuto, where should your focus be now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.52,0:08:41.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On high school. That's it. Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.52,0:08:44.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's where you should be\Nputting all of your efforts,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.24,0:08:47.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not just during class,\Nbut all the time. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.02,0:08:50.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to study hard and get into college.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.16,0:08:52.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's already the summer\Nof your junior year.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.76,0:08:56.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your mother said you wanted to\Ngo to America and study there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.56,0:08:57.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that still your plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.46,0:09:01.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I was thinking about that and...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.12,0:09:04.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.50,0:09:06.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I sort of changed my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.94,0:09:07.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sort of how?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.52,0:09:11.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still want to major in\Nelectrical engineering,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.26,0:09:13.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but here, at Toto Institute, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.60,0:09:17.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After that, I want to work at, or,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.68,0:09:21.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, the Oceanic Exploration\Nand Research Institute.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.26,0:09:33.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Father, excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.40,0:09:37.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I first presented myself\Nas a knight to my father,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.34,0:09:39.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am sure he had his reservations.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.94,0:09:43.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through my actions, I proved to\Nhim the depth of my conviction.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.74,0:09:47.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I am sure in the end, he understood\Nmy choice to remain a knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.00,0:09:53.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito, or rather Kazuto, also\Nfollows the path he believes is just.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.92,0:09:58.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I know this, because despite being\Nan ordinary student in this world,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.62,0:10:01.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in my world, he was the\Ngreatest swordsman of all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.38,0:10:05.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One who fought gallantly to\Nprotect countless others.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.48,0:10:06.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.10,0:10:07.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.88,0:10:09.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.00,0:10:14.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, his mother and I know\Nabout everything he's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.46,0:10:17.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's as much of a hero in\Nthis world as he was in yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.20,0:10:20.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't you, Black Swordsman?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.82,0:10:22.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kazuto.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.04,0:10:28.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To choose a path, to study, to\Nattend a university and get a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.20,0:10:32.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those are just part of a process\Nand the fruits of your labor,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.50,0:10:34.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it's okay to change your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.48,0:10:36.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just try to live without regrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.36,0:10:38.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all we expect of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.36,0:10:45.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will, promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.38,0:10:48.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.29,0:10:49.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.82,0:11:05.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito, wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.62,0:11:07.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.70,0:11:14.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.80,0:11:19.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alice! Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.76,0:11:21.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you lower your voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.60,0:11:23.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sorry, it's just that...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.84,0:11:25.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.04,0:11:27.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wearing next to nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.86,0:11:30.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.77,0:11:32.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I demand you stop leering!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.74,0:11:37.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.65,0:11:39.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's late. What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.90,0:11:44.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Approximately five minutes ago, while I\Nwas connected to your so-called network,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.38,0:11:49.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I received an alarming communication\Nvia your world's remote messaging art.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.44,0:11:51.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Email? From whom?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.54,0:11:53.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It had no name ascribed to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.60,0:11:55.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They wrote...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.62,0:11:58.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, it would be\Nquicker if you read it.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:05.74,0:12:08.99,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fs16\fnHelveticaNeue LT 55 Roman\c&H3F363A&\frz0.3815\pos(835.371,301)}[Climb the white tower, and ye shall reach unto yon world.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:05.74,0:12:08.99,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fs16\fnHelveticaNeue LT 55 Roman\c&H3F363A&\pos(874.571,321)\frz0.3815}Training_Hall_#2.Media Storage.Senate.Geographical_Records_Room]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.04,0:12:10.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.58,0:12:21.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yui, are you up?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.44,0:12:24.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am now, Daddy. Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.58,0:12:26.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry to wake you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.70,0:12:28.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need a favor. Sure.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:28.76,0:12:28.85,Signs,,0,0,0,,{=1}{\fscx100\fscy100\alpha&H00&\blur0.6\fax0.11\fs25\fnHelveticaNeue LT 55 Roman\c&H574544&\frz198\pos(1318.76,1027.51)}[Climb the white tower, and ye shall reach unto yon world.
