Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.36,0:12:34.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.27,0:12:37.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These are the names of floors\Nin the Central Cathedral.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.88,0:12:39.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.79,0:12:41.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Training Hall 2 is Floor 52.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.62,0:12:43.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Media Storage is Floor 68.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.96,0:12:45.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Senate is on 96.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.34,0:12:47.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Geographical Records is Floor 58.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.76,0:12:52.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at that.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:52.79,0:12:55.00,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fax0.11\fs32\fnHelveticaNeue LT 55 Roman\c&H5E4E4B&\frz14.87\pos(697.933,517.535)}[Climb the white tower, and ye shall reach unto yon world.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:52.79,0:12:55.00,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fax0.11\fs32\fnHelveticaNeue LT 55 Roman\c&H5E4E4B&\frz14.87\pos(775.857,532.465)}Training Hall #2.Media Storage.Senate.Geographical Records Room]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.32,0:12:55.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An IP address. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.64,0:12:59.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems the white\Ntower to climb is the IP
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.86,0:13:02.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,address you deciphered\Nfrom the second line.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.30,0:13:05.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's so, you're supposed\Nto follow it to reach Yon World.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.88,0:13:10.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So basically, it says this\Naddress is pointing to a server.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.02,0:13:13.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's it. I get it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.20,0:13:15.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.46,0:13:16.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the way back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.68,0:13:20.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the path leading\Nto the Underworld!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.28,0:13:23.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The way back? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.88,0:13:26.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then that means we can...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.18,0:13:29.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can return to my world.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.18,0:13:32.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My home. My people.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.66,0:13:34.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.52,0:13:46.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that that's settled, I was thinking\Nwhen we go back to the Underworld,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.74,0:13:51.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, is it cool if Asuna comes along too?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.34,0:13:55.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose so.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.28,0:13:58.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we find ourselves in danger,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.26,0:14:01.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'll need as many warriors\Nat our disposal as we can get.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.26,0:14:06.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.90,0:14:11.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.81,0:14:14.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get the feeling he might be behind this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.62,0:14:15.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.54,0:14:16.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He probably is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.20,0:14:25.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yui, did you find anything\Nelse out about that address?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.76,0:14:28.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could only get as far as\Nthe server's relay point.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.92,0:14:33.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The firewall it has is super tough, so\NI couldn't go any further. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.94,0:14:34.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.14,0:14:36.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's time we dove in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.24,0:14:39.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We shouldn't be in any danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.60,0:14:40.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.76,0:14:43.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you get in trouble,\NI'll swoop in and save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.10,0:14:45.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn right you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.56,0:14:46.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, see ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.54,0:14:52.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember, a couple\Nhundred years have passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.48,0:14:56.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Human Empire and Dark Territory\Ncould be way different now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.18,0:14:58.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch your backs in there, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.34,0:15:02.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, but Administrator ruled\Nthe Human Empire for 300 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.58,0:15:04.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a bit longer than we've been gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.90,0:15:07.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I doubt it's changed all that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.66,0:15:12.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we log in, the first thing\Nwe'll do is go wake Selka up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.04,0:15:13.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.46,0:15:18.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Kirito. Asuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.36,0:15:21.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.78,0:15:24.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you ready to dive in? Ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.10,0:15:45.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.72,0:15:50.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were in outer space!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.32,0:15:58.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito, look there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.12,0:16:02.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
