Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.54,0:17:21.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's on her last leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.78,0:17:22.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.72,0:17:23.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to eject.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.06,0:17:27.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The thrusters on your flight suit\Nshould get you back to Garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.46,0:17:28.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.48,0:17:30.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.18,0:17:32.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't just abandon her!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.28,0:17:35.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right. You can't.
