Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.34,0:17:42.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna fight to the end, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.16,0:17:43.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.78,0:17:46.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.96,0:18:08.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.42,0:18:09.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a man!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.22,0:18:27.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can't fight that thing\Nwith a couple swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.44,0:18:33.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Release recollection.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.18,0:18:54.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Release Recollection!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.20,0:19:33.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did they kill it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.52,0:19:36.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think they killed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.32,0:19:38.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That monster's not dead yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.16,0:19:42.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.07,0:19:43.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's getting away!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.06,0:19:46.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to burn it up\Nbefore it regenerates!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.94,0:19:57.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That Swordsman...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.22,0:19:58.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That knight...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.92,0:20:00.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've seen her before.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.36,0:20:02.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, so have I.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.82,0:20:04.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Lady Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.60,0:20:09.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Release recollection.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.48,0:20:30.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.32,0:20:44.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my gosh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.02,0:20:45.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you look it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.18,0:20:47.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you see him?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.28,0:20:49.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The man wearing black! I know him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.56,0:20:51.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Laura.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.47,0:20:52.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.60,0:20:53.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.62,0:21:14.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What color of your soul\Nis the color of your soul?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.44,0:21:38.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.06,0:21:56.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
